      "title": "fix: backport upstream gamescope fix for games left behind Steam's loading screen",
      "summary": "Some Proton games open behind Steam on two Xwayland servers: the screen stays on Steam's black loading screen with ABORT GAME while the game runs and plays sound underneath. Reported on Discord for Skyrim SE and A Plague Tale: Innocence (RM11 Pro), and Burnout Paradise Remastered (RedMagic Astra 2). It is intermittent: Skyrim reproduced on the AYN Thor about once in six launches, on the first",
      "publishedAt": 1791401784000
